OL,3,GNEWSAFree blood pressure checks offered
OL,4,Ain September
OL,5,
OL,6,FFree blood pressure checks are being
OL,7,Foffered to islanders as part of a
OL,8,Fcampaign targeting cardiovascular
OL,9,Fdisease.
OL,11,FA number of pharmacies are offering the
OL,12,Fchecks between from 7-13 September.
OL,14,FMark Harris, lead for the Jersey Heart
OL,15,FSupport Group, said: "Knowing your
OL,16,Fblood pressure is one of the simplest
OL,17,Fways to understand more about your
OL,18,Fhealth."
OL,20,FThe most recent data showed
OL,21,Fcardiovascular disease to be the second
OL,22,Fhighest cause of death on the island.
